Subject: [PATCH] VBA: Word text and paragraphs as in Word, FileDialog in Word, Find.Found

Range.Text gives paragraph marks as vbCr, a paragraph range ends after its mark,
Underline reads back as set, tables of a range are found, Application.FileDialog,
Find.Found.
---
--- a/sw/source/ui/vba/vbafont.cxx
+++ b/sw/source/ui/vba/vbafont.cxx
@@ -77,7 +77,7 @@
         for ( auto const & index: UnderLineTable )
         {
             m_MSO2OOO[ index.nMSOConst ] = index.nOOOConst;
-            m_OOO2MSO[ index.nOOOConst ] = index.nMSOConst;
+            m_OOO2MSO.emplace( index.nOOOConst, index.nMSOConst ); // HST: the first of those sharing a Writer value: wdUnderlineSingle
         }
     }
